      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "——别太过专注于思考她的话语。\r\n要专注于感受她话语之后所表达的想法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "615816ac35a5220d0cb7dfa794669608dbfb5d6eeb3879070a444c7aed001e4f",
