    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2d97fd332640c5bfbc7ef3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即便你没有跟上来，也只是“判明”了一件事。\r\n“断绝”——即是“新生”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9106f716d13d20b8e6faf891ec87630a7b64d6659e6b66dc39e82cedb887976e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
