    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07f09f8f00dddd7282202f01",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我想我理解的意思大概没有出错……\r\n我向着这片月夜下的大海起誓——\r\n无论新宇宙去向何方，我都会与她共同前行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "75bfd085fbc0e27d19016246c4c89bdae33d03268ac0d077118c6975315fdc97",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105104.json",
      "json_path": [
