        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1a70584afe65cc6176909f6",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在休息时间，不知是受了什么东西吸引，\r\n新宇宙频频眺望海面。\r\n就在这时——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0ec6a274347c14623049f1eaf278103753807088e780b066fbb7e2600e2e479b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105104.json",
