      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c108ca2bdaceb9117728b798",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "新宇宙现在……仍平安无事。\r\n看来已经是避免了在『宝冢纪念』之前因为受伤\r\n而退役的悲剧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "705ca05a98d0a0cd0cbd9870b556bbe4cb1523b5a9e9593ad7d54faa1bd8e0c0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea27788227000ee27e1e0d56",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我慢慢坐起身子。\r\n总觉得，新宇宙看上去也相当放松。",
      "source_fingerprint": "31f6e7aaa071310558ce44e0b1d0b000ba0c6e389d00f9ac566d2b7fd1442897",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1105/storytimeline_501105105.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c03821c5cd13f571828470d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽说我与她也已经相当熟悉了……\r\n但这样安心的表情，我却是头一次见到。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cda553c5f28c9579933821a18836e67762d25c027172c38e45d2b7f933a28edf",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
