      "uid": "zhcn:4f706625e99b9d463d1b6efd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员。新宇宙与你，\r\n是否已经『脱离』了呢……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f19658b409128a7a8f65f516fd6f8d75dccdcc1fda6a054551511c74f6fd4904",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
